##  Ultimate Survival Pack - behaviour pack - English (en_US)
## ============================================================

pack.name=Ultimate Survival Pack
pack.description=Seventeen survival modules in one add-on by LBR. Fell a tree in one swing, mine a whole ore vein with Silk Touch and Fortune intact, carry a torch in a real off-hand slot that lights the world around you, read a floating label on every dropped stack, and find your gear waiting in a grave chest. Every module has an on/off switch, English and French are resolved per player, and nothing overwrites a vanilla recipe unless you ask it to.
